前（Ray seriea)の名前付きがあると嬉しいです\n\n後は祈さんにお任せします。よろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rabbit_soldier7/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c157f23f/uploads/origins/ebe61839-7a0f-4d41-85a1-cfcfb05acc25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9d78327ab861987fa8d3604e6591686", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c157f23f/uploads/origins/ebe61839-7a0f-4d41-85a1-cfcfb05acc25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9d78327ab861987fa8d3604e6591686, https://si.imgix.net/c157f23f/uploads/origins/ebe61839-7a0f-4d41-85a1-cfcfb05acc25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ceddbeba6b98d2a08b4634503424ec8e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c157f23f/uploads/origins/ebe61839-7a0f-4d41-85a1-cfcfb05acc25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cdcb2fda0fa84decc6dbcd2259d64a82 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Thank you for your appeal! I'd love to be drawn by you! If you could please draw me in my detective outfit in whatever hairstyle you perfect that would be amazing!please note the moon and sun pattern in her eyes. Her left eye is purple and her right is gold.: https://x.com/haerangsa__/status/1957940917655961788 \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1bF4W19lypMyej8f7RGZx-Z3xqhlMdFlO/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nFeel free to explore any poses, aesthetics, or ideas that inspire you. Please separate the background if possible (PSD ok)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rabbit_soldier7/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/91f28e24/uploads/origins/28397594-9569-4546-ab56-5b6fb0ac4e13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=326c12f1c465d2ad6eb83ebbfb26b2aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/91f28e24/uploads/origins/28397594-9569-4546-ab56-5b6fb0ac4e13?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=326c1